'''Sho Ayanokoji''', often styled as '''Show Ayanocozey''', is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] added in [[Version 3.4 Update|Version 3.4]] and was created by a collaboration event between [[Kishidan Collaboration Event|Battle Cats and Kishidan]]. He could be unlocked by using a [[Serial Codes|serial code]] from "Kishidan's CD (幸せにしかしねーから)" which is no longer possible due to serial codes being removed.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 162
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Sho Ayanokoji
|name2 = Shoyan & Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Shoyan & Cat''' at level 10.

